ion 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nEver since I was a child, I was so afraid of spiders and hated going to the zoo sections that included these little creatures. Today, I had a nice dinner with my best friends and watched the new Spiderman Movie.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would I ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Joy\nB) Sadness\nC) Fear\nD) Nervousness\nE) Disapproval\nF) Disgust\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would I feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) I finally overcame my fear of spiders\nB) I had a nice dinner and watched a movie with my best friends\nC) I enjoyed visiting the spider section at the zoo\nD) I was afraid of seeing a spider during the movie","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.006690883071332526,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8d8d6006945d280a8b6","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369752348,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:32","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7474c8df208f4be39447da6795fe2787"}